{"script":"s_1_18_3_y","des":"（将粗布交给尼尔。）","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"卫兵尼尔","text":"[show]太好了，非常感谢，这就是我需要的粗布。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"卫兵尼尔","text":"[show]虽然只是一些粗布，不过在现在这个环境下也足够好了。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"卫兵尼尔","text":"[show]要把这些东西加工成一个布娃娃可不容易，不过我会努力的。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"卫兵尼尔","text":"[show]对了，这个给你……[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"卫兵尼尔","text":"[show]如果你把它当做礼物送给伙伴的话，对方一定会喜欢的。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_7"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"卫兵尼尔","text":"[show]越是这种困难的时期，才越要珍惜身边的伙伴。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_8"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"卫兵尼尔","text":"[show]好了……该考虑我自己的事了。我想想……她喜欢圆形的娃娃还是方形的娃娃呢……[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_9"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"卫兵尼尔","text":"[show]等等……我小时候……是不是也送过她一个布娃娃来着……[l][cm][hide]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"","text":"[hide]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}]}